  "description": "Kun Framework audit module. Provides both (a) an audit-log writer/reader abstraction (IAuditWriter / IAuditReader / AuditableAttribute) with NullAuditWriter + EventBusAuditWriter (EF Core adapter lives in Kun.Audit.EntityFrameworkCore), and (b) a tamper-evident hash-chained operation audit behaviour (IAuditSink + IAuditChainState + AuditLogPipelineBehavior) implementing the SAD v3.0 §15.5 audit.operations contract.",
